          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "In AS 200, routers B and C are the exit points towards AS 100 and AS 300, respectively. Router B is running Cisco IOS XR and Router C is running Cisco IOS XE."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "OSPF is used as PE-CE routing protocol. In order to ensure proper reachability between AS 100 and AS 300, which two sets of configuration should an engineer apply? (Choose two.)"
